cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "onepagr" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'onepagr: Accessible One-Page Reports from ''Typst'' Templates'
version: 0.2.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23032485
abstract: Generates polished, accessible one-page (front-and-back) Portable Document
  Format (PDF) reports from analysis output, designed to meet the Web Content Accessibility
  Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 level AA and the Portable Document Format Universal Accessibility
  standard (PDF/UA-1, ISO 14289-1). Uses a small set of fixed 'Typst' report templates
  and a design-token theme system. Ships built-in report templates and themes, and
  lets a consuming project replace them with its own design tokens and 'Typst' templates.
